      "lines": [
        "出的函数的图象．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "式$y=ax^3$（$a\\ne0$）给出的函数的图象叫做立方抛物线．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "如果式$y=ax^3$给出的函数的定义域不是所有数的集，而",
        "是它的一个子集，那么函数的图象是立方抛物线上点的一个",
        "子集．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "645",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "645．利用式$y=x^3$给出的函数的图象（图116）求：",
        "а）对应$x=0.8，-0.8，1.2，-1.2$的$y$值．"
      ]
    },
